 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "h",
   "es": "1 · En el taller",
   "en": ""
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡Hola, Mateo! [[c1_bienvenido|Bienvenido]] al taller.",
   "en": "Hi, Mateo! Welcome to the studio.",
   "who": "Ines",
   "audio": "audio/c1_01_Ines.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Gracias, Inés. Estoy un poco nervioso.",
   "en": "Thanks, Inés. I'm a bit nervous.",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c1_02_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Tranquilo. Toma, ponte este delantal.",
   "en": "Relax. Here, put on this apron.",
   "who": "Ines",
   "audio": "audio/c1_03_Ines.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¿Para qué es?",
   "en": "What is it for?",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c1_04_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Para no mancharte la camisa con la pintura.",
   "en": "So you don't get paint on your shirt.",
   "who": "Ines",
   "audio": "audio/c1_05_Ines.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡Buena idea! ¿[[c1_donde_me_pongo|Dónde me pongo]]?",
   "en": "Good idea! Where do I stand?",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c1_06_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Aquí, delante de este caballete.",
   "en": "Here, in front of this easel.",
   "who": "Ines",
   "audio": "audio/c1_07_Ines.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¿[[c1_me_puede_ayudar|Me puede ayudar]]? No sé por dónde empezar.",
   "en": "Can you help me? I don't know where to start.",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c1_08_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Claro. Coge el pincel así, con suavidad.",
   "en": "Of course. Hold the brush like this, gently.",
   "who": "Ines",
   "audio": "audio/c1_09_Ines.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¿Así? ¿Está bien?",
   "en": "Like this? Is it right?",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c1_10_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Casi. Más arriba, con la mano relajada.",
   "en": "Almost. Higher up, with your hand relaxed.",
   "who": "Ines",
   "audio": "audio/c1_11_Ines.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Uf, no sé si puedo hacerlo. [[c1_ni_idea|Ni idea]].",
   "en": "Phew, I don't know if I can do it. No idea.",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c1_12_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Sí puedes. Pintar es como caminar: paso a paso.",
   "en": "Yes, you can. Painting is like walking: step by step.",
   "who": "Ines",
   "audio": "audio/c1_13_Ines.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "h",
   "es": "2 · En la tienda de arte",
   "en": ""
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡Hola! ¿[[c2_te_puedo_ayudar|Te puedo ayudar]]?",
   "en": "Hi! Can I help you?",
   "who": "Dependienta",
   "audio": "audio/c2_01_Dependienta.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Sí, busco un lienzo pequeño para pintar en casa.",
   "en": "Yes, I'm looking for a small canvas to paint at home.",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c2_02_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Este es muy bueno. Es de algodón.",
   "en": "This one is very good. It's cotton.",
   "who": "Dependienta",
   "audio": "audio/c2_03_Dependienta.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¿[[c2_cuanto_cuesta|Cuánto cuesta]] ese lienzo pequeño?",
   "en": "How much is that small canvas?",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c2_04_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Doce euros.",
   "en": "Twelve euros.",
   "who": "Dependienta",
   "audio": "audio/c2_05_Dependienta.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Vale. ¿Y tienes pinceles?",
   "en": "OK. And do you have brushes?",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c2_06_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Sí, allí. ¿Quieres uno grande o uno fino?",
   "en": "Yes, over there. Do you want a big one or a thin one?",
   "who": "Dependienta",
   "audio": "audio/c2_07_Dependienta.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "[[c2_uno_de_cada|Uno de cada]], por favor.",
   "en": "One of each, please.",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c2_08_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Muy bien. ¿Algo más?",
   "en": "Very good. Anything else?",
   "who": "Dependienta",
   "audio": "audio/c2_09_Dependienta.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "No, gracias. ¿Puedo [[c2_pagar_en_efectivo|pagar en efectivo]]?",
   "en": "No, thanks. Can I pay in cash?",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c2_10_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Claro. Son doce euros con cincuenta.",
   "en": "Of course. That's twelve euros fifty.",
   "who": "Dependienta",
   "audio": "audio/c2_11_Dependienta.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Aquí tienes. ¡[[c2_me_flipa|Me flipa]] esta tienda!",
   "en": "Here you are. I love this shop!",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c2_12_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡Gracias! Te lo envuelvo en papel.",
   "en": "Thanks! I'll wrap it in paper for you.",
   "who": "Dependienta",
   "audio": "audio/c2_13_Dependienta.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "h",
   "es": "3 · En el Museo Picasso",
   "en": ""
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Buenas tardes. ¿[[c3_cuantas_entradas|Cuántas entradas]]?",
   "en": "Good afternoon. How many tickets?",
   "who": "Taquillero",
   "audio": "audio/c3_01_Taquillero.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Una, por favor. ¿Cuánto es?",
   "en": "One, please. How much is it?",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c3_02_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Son nueve euros.",
   "en": "That's nine euros.",
   "who": "Taquillero",
   "audio": "audio/c3_03_Taquillero.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¿[[c3_hay_descuento|Hay descuento]] para profesores?",
   "en": "Is there a discount for teachers?",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c3_04_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "No, lo siento. Solo para estudiantes.",
   "en": "No, sorry. Only for students.",
   "who": "Taquillero",
   "audio": "audio/c3_05_Taquillero.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "No pasa nada. Aquí tienes.",
   "en": "No problem. Here you are.",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c3_06_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Gracias. Aquí tienes la entrada y un mapa.",
   "en": "Thanks. Here's the ticket and a map.",
   "who": "Taquillero",
   "audio": "audio/c3_07_Taquillero.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¿Dónde están los cuadros más famosos?",
   "en": "Where are the most famous paintings?",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c3_08_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "En la [[c3_sala_tres_a_la_derecha|sala tres, a la derecha]].",
   "en": "In room three, on the right.",
   "who": "Taquillero",
   "audio": "audio/c3_09_Taquillero.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¿[[c3_puedo_hacer_fotos|Puedo hacer fotos]]?",
   "en": "Can I take photos?",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c3_10_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Sí, pero [[c3_sin_flash|sin flash]], por favor.",
   "en": "Yes, but without flash, please.",
   "who": "Taquillero",
   "audio": "audio/c3_11_Taquillero.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Perfecto. ¿[[c3_a_que_hora_cierra|A qué hora cierra]] el museo?",
   "en": "Perfect. What time does the museum close?",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c3_12_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "A las siete. ¡Que disfrutes!",
   "en": "At seven. Enjoy!",
   "who": "Taquillero",
   "audio": "audio/c3_13_Taquillero.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "h",
   "es": "4 · En el patio",
   "en": ""
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Mateo, ¿qué te trae a Málaga?",
   "en": "Mateo, what brings you to Málaga?",
   "who": "Ines",
   "audio": "audio/c4_01_Ines.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Dejé mi trabajo de oficina a los cuarenta años.",
   "en": "I left my office job at forty.",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c4_02_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡[[c4_que_valiente|Qué valiente]]! ¿Y ahora qué haces?",
   "en": "How brave! And what do you do now?",
   "who": "Ines",
   "audio": "audio/c4_03_Ines.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Viajo y pruebo cosas nuevas. ¡Me flipa!",
   "en": "I travel and try new things. I love it!",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c4_04_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¿Y qué tal la clase de hoy?",
   "en": "And how was today's class?",
   "who": "Ines",
   "audio": "audio/c4_05_Ines.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Bien, pero el verde me salió muy oscuro. ¡[[c4_que_mala_pata|Qué mala pata]]!",
   "en": "Good, but my green came out very dark. What bad luck!",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c4_06_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡Ja, ja! Los errores son parte del trabajo.",
   "en": "Ha ha! Mistakes are part of the work.",
   "who": "Ines",
   "audio": "audio/c4_07_Ines.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Quiero volver. ¿Puedo [[c4_reservar|reservar]] el sábado?",
   "en": "I want to come back. Can I book Saturday?",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c4_08_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Claro. ¿[[c4_a_que_hora_te_va_bien|A qué hora te va bien]]?",
   "en": "Of course. What time suits you?",
   "who": "Ines",
   "audio": "audio/c4_09_Ines.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "A las diez, [[c4_si_hay_plaza|si hay plaza]].",
   "en": "At ten, if there's a place.",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c4_10_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Sí, hay plaza. Te apunto en mi agenda.",
   "en": "Yes, there's a place. I'll put you in my diary.",
   "who": "Ines",
   "audio": "audio/c4_11_Ines.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "¡Genial! ¿Tengo que traer algo?",
   "en": "Great! Do I have to bring anything?",
   "who": "Mateo",
   "audio": "audio/c4_12_Mateo.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "d",
   "es": "Solo tu cuaderno y muchas ganas. ¡Hasta el sábado!",
   "en": "Just your notebook and lots of enthusiasm. See you Saturday!",
   "who": "Ines",
   "audio": "audio/c4_13_Ines.mp3"
  },
  {
   "t": "v",
   "es": "Frases clave de la semana"
  }
 ],
